Presidential elections were held in the [[Dominican Republic]] on 16 May 2008. The result was a victory for incumbent President [[Leonel Fernández]] of the [[Dominican Liberation Party]].<ref>[http://www.iht.com/articles/ap/2008/05/17/news/Dominican-Election.php Dominican Republic president declares re-election victory with 54 percent of vote] Associated Press, 17 May 2008</ref>

